        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Victor Salva, Emilio Fernández\n- Films: Jeepers Creepers 2, Rossana\n- Organizations: American Zoetrope, Capitol Films, Myriad Pictures, United Artists, Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Emilio Fernández was born as Emilio Fernández Romo on March 26, 1904, and died on August 6, 1986.\n- Rossana, also known in Spanish as La red, is a 1953 Mexican drama film directed by Emilio Fernández.\n- Victor Ronald Salva was born on March 29, 1958, and he is an American film director and screenwriter.\n- Jeepers Creepers 2 is a 2003 American horror film written and directed by Victor Salva.\n- Jeepers Creepers 2 was produced by American Zoetrope, Capitol Films, and Myriad Pictures.\n- Jeepers Creepers 2 was distributed by United Artists, a division of Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer.",
